@startuml creator-claim-state
title WF-04 | Creator Claim State Machine
hide empty description
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam backgroundColor white
top to bottom direction
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor white
  BorderColor #333333
}
skinparam noteBackgroundColor white
skinparam ranksep 40

state PENDING
state APPROVED
state REJECTED
state REVOKED

[*] --> PENDING : / persist submitted evidence
PENDING --> APPROVED : review(APPROVED)\n[authorized reviewer, valid claimant and invitation if applicable,\nchannel available (BR-23/24/27/70)]\n/ link Creator Master and audit the decision
PENDING --> REJECTED : review(REJECTED)\n[authorized reviewer and valid review details (BR-70)]\n/ record rejection and audit
PENDING --> REJECTED : review(APPROVED)\n[decision applies to another pending claim for the same channel (BR-27)]\n/ reject this competing claim and audit
APPROVED --> REVOKED : revoke\n[authorized reviewer, reason supplied and claimant still owns channel (BR-70)]\n/ revoke manual evidence; clear ownership only if no valid proof remains
REJECTED --> [*]
REVOKED --> [*]

note right of APPROVED
  The claim can be revoked. An independent valid
  verification may preserve the channel's ownership.
end note
@enduml
